cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite the archived AsymptoticGadget4 software release and the GADGET-4 code
  paper when using this software. Add the release DOI from the GitHub/Zenodo
  record to your citation.
title: AsymptoticGadget4
type: software
abstract: >-
  A research fork of GADGET-4 that adds turnaround spherical-overdensity
  catalogue fields, carries group properties into merger-tree output, and
  provides portable configurations and validation tooling.
authors:
  - family-names: Irving
    given-names: Bryen
repository-code: https://github.com/beirving4/AsymptoticGadget4
license: GPL-3.0-only
keywords:
  - cosmological simulation
  - GADGET-4
  - halo catalogues
  - merger trees
  - large-scale structure
references:
  - type: article
    title: Simulating cosmic structure formation with the GADGET-4 code
    authors:
      - family-names: Springel
        given-names: Volker
      - family-names: Pakmor
        given-names: Ruediger
      - family-names: Zier
        given-names: Oliver
      - family-names: Reinecke
        given-names: Martin
    doi: 10.1093/mnras/stab1855
    year: 2021
